.TH BACKGROUND 2 2000-1月 "geneSet.filter" "geneSet.filter"
.SH NAME
geneSet.filter \- Remove the clusters from the given background model by the cluster id.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIgeneSet.filter(\fBbackground\fR as <generic> Background, 
\fBgeneSet\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBmin_size\fR as integer = 3, 
\fBmax_intersects\fR as integer = 500, 
\fBremove_clusters\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Remove the clusters from the given background model by the cluster id.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBbackground\fB \fR\- the GSEA background model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBid_removes\fB \fR\- a character vector of the cluster ids that will be removed from the background model.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a new [Background](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.Background) model that does not contains the removed clusters,
 the \fBsize\fR of the result model is re-evaluated from the remaining clusters.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
background
